  "everydeck_tables": {
   "type": "array",
   "maxItems": 20,
   "items": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
     "table",
     "evidence"
    ],
    "properties": {
     "table": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/name"
     },
     "evidence": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"
     }
    }
   },
   "description": "tables the everydeck installation added to the app (outbox, operator links, the request log of the app bridge) with the place that creates them: everydeck's own, never objects of the app; also tables in everydeck's schemas (everydeck_outbox, everydeck_read, everydeck_bridge) and tables defined in the file of an everydeck adapter"
  },
  "display_ends": {
   "type": "array",
   "maxItems": 200,
   "items": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
     "element",
     "path",
     "line",
     "fact"
    ],
    "properties": {
     "element": {
      "enum": [
       "image",
       "link",
       "textarea",
       "long_text",
       "date"
      ]
     },
     "path": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 300
     },
     "line": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 1
     },
     "fact": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 300
     }
    }
   },
   "description": "places where the app shows a value as an image, link, textarea, text with line breaks or date, but the value cannot be followed back to a column; the fact says where the path ends (a call of a function, a property that is no column, a fixed value); the generator writes it, nothing is guessed"
  },
  "unreachable": {
   "type": "array",
   "maxItems": 500,
   "items": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
     "path",
     "fact"
    ],
    "properties": {
     "path": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 300
     },
     "fact": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 300
     }
    }
   },
   "description": "frontend files no entry of the app reaches through imports (entries from facts of the project: <script src> of an HTML file, route files of a framework the package.json names, package.json main): no page, no display location; the generator writes it, everydeck-check checks it with the same rule"
  },
  "works_with": {
   "type": "array",
   "maxItems": 200,
   "items": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
     "table",
     "evidence"
    ],
    "properties": {
     "table": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/name"
     },
     "evidence": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"
     },
     "part_of": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/name"
     }
    }
   },
   "description": "what the users of the app work with: the things they see, create or edit in the UI; one entry per table with the place in the UI (page or component, file:line); part_of names the table whose detail page shows it (CVs with the candidate, members with the workspace) and gets no menu item of its own. This list is the main navigation; every other table is under 'All data'. A description with evidence, no judgement: everydeck-check checks that the place exists and names the table (or carries a display location of the table)"
  },
  "flow_candidates": {
   "type": "array",
   "maxItems": 500,
   "description": "written by the scaffold: every write of the browser to a table or an API route, every trigger of the app, every place the app signs people up or in, resets a password, opens a checkout or receives a payment webhook. Each one is a flow of the app map (result.write on its table, its place as the start, or the purpose) or carries left_out with the reason; required ones cannot be left out",
   "items": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": [
     "id",
     "source",
     "kind",
     "evidence"
    ],
    "properties": {
     "id": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 200
     },
     "source": {
      "enum": [
       "browser_write",
       "trigger",
       "auth",
       "payment"
      ]
     },
     "kind": {
      "enum": [
       "insert",
       "update",
       "upsert",
       "delete",
       "request",
       "sign_up",
       "sign_in",
       "password_reset",
       "checkout",
       "webhook"
      ]
     },
     "table": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/name"
     },
     "route": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 1,
      "maxLength": 300
     },
     "handler": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"
     },
     "evidence": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"
     },
     "required": {
      "type": "boolean"
     },
     "left_out": {
      "type": "string",
      "minLength": 3,
      "maxLength": 300
     }
    }
   }
  },
